{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38626","headline":"蜀中登第荅李搏六韵 · 裴廷裕","name":"蜀中登第荅李搏六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何劳问我成都事，亦报君知便纳降。\n蜀柳笼堤烟矗矗，海棠当户燕双双。\n富春不并穷师子，濯锦全胜旱曲江。\n高卷绦纱扬氏宅，半垂红袖薛涛牕。\n浣花泛鷁诗千首，静衆寻梅酒百缸。\n若说弦歌与风景，主人兼是碧油幢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴廷裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}